up a fist.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "The other two freeze.", "para": 2, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "A distant HUM.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "A headlight sweeps across the far end of the tunnel.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "An automatic ore train, no driver.", "para": 3, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Ore train. Down.", "name": "RAFF", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": ["whisper"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "All three drop behind the ore cart.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "Lamps off.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "Tobias presses a hand over Mouse's shoulder.", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "She flinches, then steadies.", "para": 4, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "The train grinds past.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "Its headlight slides over the cart.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "Stops.", "para": 5, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Don't breathe.", "name": "TOBIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": ["barely audible"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "The beam holds, searching.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "Mouse's eyes are huge.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "Raff's hand eases toward a rubber mallet at his belt.", "para": 6, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "A relay CLACKS.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "The track switches.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "The beam swings away.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "The train recedes.", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "The three exhale together.", "para": 8, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That was...", "name": "MOUSE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Still on schedule. Move.", "name": "RAFF", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "They rise.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "They move faster.", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}]}